  "name": "Rolling Spread",
  "description": "On the one-minute BTC up/down: record fair minus ask on every book change into a rolling window of the last 20 readings. Once at least 10 readings are in, buy up at market when the average discount is over 3 cents, the readings are tight (range under 2 cents), at least 3 of them exceeded 5 cents, and the discount is not shrinking (newest at least the oldest). Once per window.",
